between-treatment comparisons of area under the curve (AUC) for change from predose values during hours 0-4, 0-8, 8-12, 
and 0-12. Safety was assessed. RESULTS Fifty-three children completed the study. For all efficacy measures, improvements
from predose were significantly greater with ER-MPH 40 mg than with OROS-MPH 36 mg in terms of AUC(0-4) (p < or = 
