both doses of OROS-MPH in AUC(0-4), AUC(0-8), and AUC(0-12). No serious adverse events were reported. CONCLUSIONS The 
efficacy of ER-MPH 20 mg is similar to that of OROS-MPH 18 and 36 mg during the first 8 hours postdose. Statistically 
