│ methylphenidate HCl) extended-release tablets, CII. Little empirical information exists to help the clinician        │
│ compare the PD effects of the available ER formulations on attention and behavior. Previous studies have shown that  │
│ the near-equal doses of MCD and CON provide equivalent, total exposure to MPH as measured by area under the plasma   │
