=== BATCH SCREENING TASK ===
Review: Methylphenidate for children and adolescents with attention deficit hyperactivity disorder (ADHD)
Total studies to screen: 9

SELECTION CRITERIA:
We included all randomised clinical trials (RCTs) comparing methylphenidate versus placebo or no intervention in 
children and adolescents aged 18 years and younger with a diagnosis of ADHD. The search was not limited by publication 
year or language, but trial inclusion required that 75% or more of participants had a normal intellectual quotient (IQ >
